      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَبْصَبٌ</span></b> , (M, K,) applied to a camel, (M,)
<i>Thick,</i> or <i>big, and strong;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُبَاصِبٌ</span></b> ,
(M, K, TA, in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَبَاصِب</span>,) so applied;
(M;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَبْصَابٌ</span></b> , (K,) likewise so applied.
(TA.)

